# Worked example transcript for cases/transcript/example-stop-state.case.sh.
#
# Format: one step per line, see dynamic-qa/acceptance/lib/transcript.sh for
# the full grammar. This transcript plays out a capability-gate style stop:
# a question is asked, a scripted owner answers it, and the run stops
# without writing anything to the fixture repository.
ask|capability-gate|Is a verified dynamic-skills-setup capability profile present for this harness?
answer|capability-gate|absent
stop|missing-capability-profile
